# SMSKUB SMS Skill

When the user wants to **send SMS, write an SMS message, pick a Sender Name, check SMS credit, or
run an SMS campaign**, read and follow **[SKILL.md](mdc:SKILL.md)** in this repo exactly —
including the **mandatory cost preview + confirmation before sending**, the character→credit rules
(Thai ≤70 = 1 credit), and the PDPA/NBTC guardrails.

- **SMSKUB MCP connected** (configure via `.cursor/mcp.json`) → Connected mode (compose AND send).
  See [mcp/SETUP.md](mdc:mcp/SETUP.md).
- **No MCP** → Compose-only mode: produce a ready-to-send package; never claim it was sent.
